## Proof of Completion
<!-- Entry-point proof-of-completion workflow — run before filling this section:
1. \`chatroom messages anchor --chatroom-id="test-chatroom-id" --role="coordinator"\` — locate the user's last message (and prior user messages for context)
2. \`chatroom messages download --chatroom-id="test-chatroom-id" --role="coordinator" --since-message-id="<from-anchor>" --limit=100\` — download grep-friendly history since anchor; read handoffs and goals
3. If the user's last message was terse (e.g. "do it", "raise a PR"), review prior user messages from anchor output and widen --limit before validating
4. Validate commits/PRs against ALL requirements — not just the last slice. Incomplete → rework; do NOT hand off to user.
Then: \`chatroom messages anchor --chatroom-id="test-chatroom-id" --role="coordinator"\` → \`chatroom messages download --chatroom-id="test-chatroom-id" --role="coordinator" --since-message-id="<from-anchor>" --limit=100\` (use the message ID from anchor output as --since-message-id) -->
